# graft — all of it regenerable by re-running the indexer, none of it ours.
#
# The graph cache itself (`graft build` rebuilds it), plus the per-harness files
# graft writes on install. Every one of these was verified to be pure graft
# output: the three instruction files are byte-identical, wrapped start-to-end
# in <!-- graft:start --> markers with nothing after them, and each JSON
# registers the graft MCP server and nothing else.
#
# If you ever hand-write content into one of these — an AGENTS.md that says
# something about THIS repo, an .mcp.json with a second server — un-ignore that
# file, because this will otherwise keep it out of the tree silently.
/graft/
/.ignore
/AGENTS.md
/GEMINI.md
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
/.mcp.json
/opencode.json

# Per-harness local agent config, same bucket as .claude/ and .commandcode/
# above. Currently graft-only, but these dirs are the harness's to own.
/.cursor/
/.gemini/
/.kiro/
